description: TypeScript — no any, typed props, clean unused
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript

- New code in `.ts`/`.tsx`; props/public shapes via `interface`; no `any` (`unknown` + narrow).
- Drop unused imports/vars; destructure only used fields.
- Explicit return types on exported `lib/` helpers and server actions.
- Prefer `as const`/unions over magic strings; no `@ts-ignore`/`@ts-expect-error` unless commented why.
